flowchart TB
  scope[Isolated private evidence candidate / tests only] --> request[Injected product schemas / strict request and capability]
  request --> transcript[Two NDJSON frames / EOF / independent peer / public byte hash]
  transcript -- refuse or partial --> local[Fixed local status / preserve public result]
  transcript -- validated --> pending[Pending metadata / no native capture proof]
  off[OFF seam] --> normalOnly[Normal operation once / return same result or exception]
  on[ON synthetic seam] --> normalOn[Normal operation once / preserve result / propagate exception]
  normalOn -- normal result --> snapshots[Injected OS / worker / capacity snapshots]
  snapshots --> local
  subgraph binding[Caller-owned binding state / no filesystem]
    prepared[Prepared exact report bytes] --> finalized[Finalized bytes / one parent / last_update only]
    finalized --> delivery[Per-report body hash delivery event]
    finalized -- missing or conflicting parent --> unbound[Unbound or conflict / keep previous state]
  end
  subgraph retention[Caller-owned retention state / no worker or physical deletion]
    reserve[Verified inventory and lock / reserve maximum bytes] --> settle[Complete or partial / same owner]
    settle --> observe{Ownership and dead identity verified?}
    observe -- no or unknown --> retain[Retain original charge]
    observe -- yes / partial stale after 24h --> plan[Plan oldest eligible tombstones]
    plan --> charge[Deletion not complete / capacity still charged]
    charge --> ack{Same owner and verified deletion ACK?}
    ack -- no --> retain
    ack -- yes --> deleted[Remove metadata / capacity available]
  end
  scope --> binding
  scope --> retention
  actual[Normal scan / report / queue] -. no import or runtime integration .-> scope
